{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19601","headline":"赋得竹箭有筠 · 李程","name":"赋得竹箭有筠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常爱凌寒竹，坚贞可喻人。\n能将先进礼，义与後凋邻。\n冉冉犹全节，青青尚有筠。\n陶钧二仪内，柯叶四时春。\n待凤花仍吐，停霜色更新。\n方持不易操，对此欲观身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李程","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}